fields.lyrics:
1.
Ka ma Jawar nothona e Yath,
Luok mar richo duto nitie;
Rembe nyalo loso chunyi mapoth
Nyingeni duong'!

Nyinge ni duong'!
Nyinge ni duong'!
Rembe noluoko chunya maler;
Nyinge ni duong'!

2. 
Kuom warruok maduong' kama!
Yesu okelo hawi kuoma;
Nothona e Yath, nogayowa;
Nyinge ni duong'!

3. 
Soko ma nochuwer mowarowa,
Omiya mor kasedonje;
Yesu owara, oritowa;
Nyinge ni duong'!

4.
Biuru e Soko machuwernu;
Keturu chunyu kuom Jawaru;
Yieuru koro noluoku;
Nyinge ni duong'!

1.
Bedi koda, piny koro oyusona;
Polo to chido, Yesu bed koda;
Ka onge moro ma dikonya,
Jakony jochan lwuon, bedi koda.

2.
Chien'g ndalona to koro orumona;
Gik ma nagombo tinde okadhona;
Duto maneno lokore to tho,
In mak ilokori, bedi koda.

3.
Pile achando, pile adwaro In,
In kendi' iloyo teko ma Jachien;
In kendi' itera, In midembo an;
E mudho kendo e chieng', bedi koda.

4.
Onge ma luoro, In kibet koda;
Eka masira dak oloya ngang';
Teko mar tho gi liel igolo ka,
An bende anyalogi, ka In koda.

5.
Chieng' tho inyisa kaka In nitho,
Ka piny ochido polo ek' orieny:
Piny cha noru, to mudho duto' rumo
Kangima kat' atho, bedi koda

1.
Onge moro maduong' ka Yesu,
En olo, En olo
Onge maromo gi Ruodhwa Yesu,
Kata achiel, kata achiel;
Yesu kende noa e polo,
Yesu kende e Wuod Nyasaye;
Onge moro maduong' ka Yesu,
Kata achiel, kata achiel.

2.
Onge moro maber ka Yesu.
En olo, En olo;
Onge ma ti ka Nyasaye odwaro,
Kata achiel, kata achiel;
Dhano duto gibara bara;
Dhano duto giti marach,
Onge moro maber ka Yesu,
Kata achiel, kata achiel.

3.
Onge moro mang'won ka Yesu.
En olo, En olo;
Onge mahero ngang' ka Yesu,
Kata achiel, kata achiel;
Chon nobiro nokonyo dhano;
Koro Ongima, Oritogi;
Onge moro mang'won ka Yesu,
Kata achiel, kata achiel.

1.
Mond Salem nokelo Nyithindgi ir Ruoth Yesu,
Jopuonjore ne ok gimor Gidwaro riembogi.
To Yesu ka nonenogi, Nowacho ka nomor kama,
Kik ugeng' nyithindo gibi Ira ku.

2.
An to anaruakgi, Amor ahinya kodgi;
To An ahero kwayogi, a kik uriembgi un.
Ka gin gimiya chuny gi ka, e polo ginidag kod an;
Kik ugeng' nyithindo gibi Ira ku.

3.
Jakonywa ne ng'won to Noruakogi komorgo;
To podi ji mang'eny nitie Ma poko owinjo wach;
Gin pok ging'eyo wach Nyasaye
Gikiya wach mar Ruoth Yesu;
Kik ugeng' nyithindo gibi Ira ku.

1.
Yesu nolo kwonde duto
Ka ma wang' chieng' norieny maler;
Pinje nochop e giko piny
Nyaka polo gi piny norum.

2. 
Nolame pile nyaka chieng',
Ji duto nomie duong';
Nyinge mamit nopak maber.,
Joge nokulre nyim Jakony.

3. 
Dho udi ower mamor
Kuom herane moriwo ji;
Nyithindo to gipake
Kuom hapi to makonyogi.

4.
E bwoye hawi omedore;
Jachan omor kuom wach maber;
To jo matuo gigene;
Ji duto oyudo kwe kuom En.

5. 
Koro ji duto omie duong';
En Ruoth mae polo kod piny;
Malaika giwer mamor,
Wapake Ruoth ma nyaka chieng'.
